# Mutation plan for the plugin hook call sites (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 5).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-hooks.plan
#
# The decisions: what counts as a rejection for each of the two `MessageWillBe*` hooks (they
# disagree, and the disagreement is Go's), the rejection id and status, the gob conversion of
# `Post.Props`, which post each `*HasBeen*` hook is handed and in which order, the channel-guard
# fail-closed branch, the six fields of `plugin.Context`, the history row the store mutates into
# its `oldPost` argument, and the `MMRS_PLUGIN_HOST` switch itself.
#
# Every line is judged by `parity::plugin_hooks`, which runs the same plugin under a real Go host
# and under this one and diffs what it saw. The two CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.

